* Lossless transmission lines (T): a 50 ohm line of 100 us between mismatched ends (its reflections
* bounce), a 600 ohm quarter wave at 50 kHz given by F= and NL= into a resistor and a capacitor, and
* a matched 75 ohm line of 1 us, shorter than the simulator's time step. tests/models.mjs runs them
* here and in ngspice, the operating point, the response and a waveform through them.
.subckt lines in o1 m2 o2 o3
R1 in a1 25
T1 a1 0 o1 0 Z0=50 TD=100u
R1L o1 0 200
R2 in m2 300
T2 m2 0 o2 0 Z0=600 F=50k NL=0.25
R2L o2 0 1k
C2L o2 0 10n
R3 in a3 75
T3 a3 0 o3 0 Z0=75 TD=1u
R3L o3 0 75
.ends
.subckt bench in o1 m2 o2 o3
Vin in 0 DC 1 AC 1
X1 in o1 m2 o2 o3 lines
.ends
